<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frēnātor</span></b> ,
		ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				curber</i>, <i>tamer</i>, <i>controller</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(sol) ignipedum frenator equorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 1, 27</span></i>
			.— <b>Poet.</b> transf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingentis frenator Sarmata conti,</span>”
				i. e. <i>a hurler</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 6, 162</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infinitae potestatis domitor ac frenator
					animus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Pan. 55, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
